SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] BJA Adult Treatment Court Program (FY26) — due
DESCRIPTION:About $49M for courts and counties to plan\, run\, or expand adult treatment courts. Clinical training for court treatment providers is a natural budget line\, so MORE gets in through a county or court applicant.\n\nPath: Line-item · Priority 12.8\nhttps://bja.ojp.gov/funding/opportunities/o-bja-2026-172721
