DESCRIPTION:The one big pot built for for-profits — R&D money for the MORE app and training platform. Eric wants the ~$2M path\; Phase I is the door. The Sep 5 date passed\; the next standard due date is Jan 5\, 2027.\n\nPath: Direct · Priority 28.0\nhttps://simpler.grants.gov/opportunity/d1ba49e5-3684-4420-849a-ab2330ec493e
