DESCRIPTION:Up to $25M for opioid abatement in the criminal-justice system\, awards $250K–$2.5M\, categories explicitly include Workforce Development and Training — train jail/reentry clinicians in MORE layered onto MOUD. NOFA overdue\; watch closely.\n\nPath: Direct · Priority 25.6\nhttps://comptroller.texas.gov/programs/opioid-council/docs/grants/Amended-2026-OAFC-grant-issuance-plan.pdf
