SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] CCBHC Improvement & Advancement (SM-26-015) — outreach window (award ~2026-11-15)
DESCRIPTION:The application window closed 2026-08-17. What's left is the post-award play: about 117 existing CCBHCs will each get up to $1M/yr for up to 4 years to improve services. Once SAMHSA publishes the FY26 grantees\, approach the funded clinics as their EBP and workforce-training partner (budget revision or a Year-2 line).\n\nPath: Line-item · Priority 21.2\nhttps://www.samhsa.gov/grants/grant-announcements/sm-26-015
