DTSTAMP:20261030T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261104
SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] Texas OAFC — Fall 2026 CORE grants — cycle watch
DESCRIPTION:Up to $75M in multi-year (3-5 yr) settlement grants across Texas's 20 RHP regions. 'Workforce Training and Development' is an eligible category\, and MOUD expansion and pregnant/postpartum OUD get preference. MORE fits best as a training line-item or sub under a Texas MOUD provider in each target region. NOFA not yet posted.\n\nPath: Direct/Sub · Priority 18.8\nhttps://comptroller.texas.gov/programs/opioid-council/grants/grant-opp.php
