BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:md-moor-competitive-fy28-watch-20270115@more-grant-radar
DTSTAMP:20261030T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270115
SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] MOOR Competitive Grant Program (FY2028) — cycle watch
DESCRIPTION:MOOR gives out about $6M a year in competitive grants to governments and community partners. One FY27 priority was making evidence-based treatment accessible (MOUD\, holistic care\, MOUD and counseling in carceral settings\, reentry). A provider\, local health department or detention-center applicant could include MORE training to make MOUD and counseling services stronger.\n\nPath: Sub · Priority 2.0\nhttps://stopoverdose.maryland.gov/grants/
URL:https://stopoverdose.maryland.gov/grants/
