SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] WI DHS Opioid Settlement – Medications for Opioid Use Disorder Training for Providers — cycle watch
DESCRIPTION:$1M in WI state opioid settlement money is set aside for MOUD training for primary care providers at community health centers and FQHCs. MORE could join as the evidence-based behavioral and chronic-pain part of MOUD care\, as a sub or training vendor once DHS names the vehicle.\n\nPath: Sub · Priority 2.0\nhttps://www.dhs.wisconsin.gov/opioids/settlement-funds.htm
