SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] Colorado Department of Law State Share opioid settlement RFAs (next cycle) — cycle watch
DESCRIPTION:The AG's state-share RFAs have repeatedly funded behavioral-health workforce growth\, justice reentry\, and evidence-based clinical interventions for OUD. MORE clinician training for rural or justice-involved providers matches those targets well when the next RFA comes out.\n\nPath: Sub · Priority 2.0\nhttps://coag.gov/funding-opportunities/
